  "id": "qra1-l07",
  "world": "qra1",
  "source": "DHM Quran Recitation (QRA1) · lesson 7. From Dr. Hassan's course; every word in his voice, every verse by Sheikh Al-Minshawi.",
  "title": {
    "ar": "مَدُّ الْوَاوِ",
    "en": "Madd Waw"
  },
  "topic": "Read madd waw and recite Surat An-Nasr",
  "minutes": 15,
  "learn": [
    {
      "en": "Madd Waw is the letter waw with no sign on it, after a damma. It stretches the damma: the sound becomes double, “oo”.",
      "title": "Madd Waw"
    },
    {
      "en": "Now we read the name of the surah.",
      "title": "The surah",
      "ar": "سُورَةُ النَّصْرِ",
      "aud": "c-1-ar",
      "tr": "soorato annasre"
    },
    {
      "en": "Listen to Sheikh Al-Minshawi recite Surat An-Nasr. Follow with your finger, then recite it yourself.",
      "title": "Surat An-Nasr",
      "ar": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ إِذَا جَآءَ نَصْرُ ٱللَّهِ وَٱلْفَتْحُ ﴿١﴾ وَرَأَيْتَ ٱلنَّاسَ يَدْخُلُونَ فِى دِينِ ٱللَّهِ أَفْوَاجًۭا ﴿٢﴾ فَسَبِّحْ بِحَمْدِ رَبِّكَ وَٱسْتَغْفِرْهُ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ تَوَّابًۢا ﴿٣﴾",
      "aud": "c-2-ar"
    },
    {
      "en": "At the end of any gathering, the Prophet ﷺ advised us to say this du'aa: Glory is to You, O Allah, and praise. We bear witness that none has the right to be worshiped except You. We seek Your forgiveness and we turn to You in repentance.",
      "title": "At the end of our lesson",
      "ar": "سُبْحَانَكَ اللَّهُمَّ وَبِحَمْدِكَ، نَشْهَدُ أَنْ لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا أَنْتَ، نَسْتَغْفِرُكَ وَنَتُوبُ إِلَيْكَ",
      "aud": "c-3-ar",
      "tr": "Subhanaka Allahumma wa bihamdika, nashhadu an la ilaha illa anta, nastaghfiruka wa natubu ilayk"
    }
  ],
